{"entry":{"id":"l-fda8c90dd801642f","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","root":"نفق","arabic":"يُنفِقُونَ","gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","representativeKey":"8:3:6","exampleKeys":["8:3:6","2:3:8","25:67:3"],"occurrenceCount":68,"courseOrder":159,"sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"],"rootId":"r-d8f9f1845cd2af16","approval":{"status":"pending"}},"examples":[{"ref":"8:3","tokens":[{"key":"8:3:1","position":1,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"8:3:2","position":2,"arabic":"يُقِيمُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"establish","transliteration":"yuqīmūna","lemma":"أَقَامَ","root":"قوم","entryId":"l-88c394825790eb5d"},{"key":"8:3:3","position":3,"arabic":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","kind":"word","gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","root":"صلو","entryId":"l-7ecacdc275cdb0a8"},{"key":"8:3:4","position":4,"arabic":"وَمِمَّا","kind":"word","gloss":"and out of what","transliteration":"wamimmā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"8:3:5","position":5,"arabic":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"We have provided them","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","lemma":"رَزَقَ","root":"رزق","entryId":"l-95d531f7b2b6dbe6"},{"key":"8:3:6","position":6,"arabic":"يُنفِقُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","root":"نفق","entryId":"l-fda8c90dd801642f"},{"key":"8:3:7","position":7,"arabic":"٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"Who perform As-Salât (Iqâmat-as-Salât) and spend out of that We have provided them.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"8:3:6","targetGloss":"they spend","targetTransliteration":"yunfiqūna","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"2:3","tokens":[{"key":"2:3:1","position":1,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"2:3:2","position":2,"arabic":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","root":"امن","entryId":"l-f6ec3a6dc0f76aa6"},{"key":"2:3:3","position":3,"arabic":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ","kind":"word","gloss":"in the unseen","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","lemma":"غَيْب","root":"غيب","entryId":null},{"key":"2:3:4","position":4,"arabic":"وَيُقِيمُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"and establish","transliteration":"wayuqīmūna","lemma":"أَقَامَ","root":"قوم","entryId":"l-88c394825790eb5d"},{"key":"2:3:5","position":5,"arabic":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","kind":"word","gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","root":"صلو","entryId":"l-7ecacdc275cdb0a8"},{"key":"2:3:6","position":6,"arabic":"وَمِمَّا","kind":"word","gloss":"and out of what","transliteration":"wamimmā","lemma":"مَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-1323d62dd382644d"},{"key":"2:3:7","position":7,"arabic":"رَزَقْنَـٰهُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"We have provided them","transliteration":"razaqnāhum","lemma":"رَزَقَ","root":"رزق","entryId":"l-95d531f7b2b6dbe6"},{"key":"2:3:8","position":8,"arabic":"يُنفِقُونَ","kind":"word","gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","root":"نفق","entryId":"l-fda8c90dd801642f"},{"key":"2:3:9","position":9,"arabic":"٣","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"Who believe in the Ghaib and perform As-Salât (Iqâmat-as-Salât), and spend out of what We have provided for them [i.e. give Zakât ], spend on themselves, their parents, their children, their wives, etc., and also give charity to the poor and also in Allâh’s Cause - Jihâd].","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[{"text":": Al-Ghaib: literally means a thing not seen. But this word includes vast meanings: Belief in Allâh, Angels, Holy Books, Allâh’s Messengers, Day of Resurrection and Al-Qadar (Divine Pre-ordainments). It also includes what Allâh and His Messenger صلى الله عليه وسلم informed about the knowledge of the matters of past, present, and future e.g., news about the creation of the heavens and earth, botanical and zoological life, the news about the nations of the past, and about Paradise and Hell.","ref":null},{"text":": Iqâmat-as-Salât إقامة الصلاة: The performance of Salât (prayers). It means that:","ref":null},{"text":"Zakât زكاة : A certain fixed proportion of the wealth and of each and every kind of property liable to Zakât of a Muslim to be paid yearly for the benefit of the poor in the Muslim community. The payment of Zakât is obligatory as it is one of the five pillars of Islâm. Zakât is the major economic means for establishing social justice and leading the Muslim society to prosperity and security. [See Sahih Al- Bukhâri, Vol. 2, Book of Zakât, No. 24","ref":null}],"targetKey":"2:3:8","targetGloss":"they spend","targetTransliteration":"yunfiqūna","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]},{"ref":"25:67","tokens":[{"key":"25:67:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","kind":"word","gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","lemma":"الَّذِى","root":null,"entryId":"l-5016cb590bd9088a"},{"key":"25:67:2","position":2,"arabic":"إِذَآ","kind":"word","gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","lemma":"إِذَا","root":null,"entryId":"l-d00a4141bad00037"},{"key":"25:67:3","position":3,"arabic":"أَنفَقُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"they spend","transliteration":"anfaqū","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","root":"نفق","entryId":"l-fda8c90dd801642f"},{"key":"25:67:4","position":4,"arabic":"لَمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"(are) not extravagant","transliteration":"lam","lemma":"لَم","root":null,"entryId":"l-a5ee2f54ca9bbf2c"},{"key":"25:67:5","position":5,"arabic":"يُسْرِفُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"(are) not extravagant","transliteration":"yus'rifū","lemma":"أَسْرَفَ","root":"سرف","entryId":null},{"key":"25:67:6","position":6,"arabic":"وَلَمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"and are not stingy","transliteration":"walam","lemma":"لَم","root":null,"entryId":"l-a5ee2f54ca9bbf2c"},{"key":"25:67:7","position":7,"arabic":"يَقْتُرُوا۟","kind":"word","gloss":"and are not stingy","transliteration":"yaqturū","lemma":"يَقْتُرُ","root":"قتر","entryId":null},{"key":"25:67:8","position":8,"arabic":"وَكَانَ","kind":"word","gloss":"but are","transliteration":"wakāna","lemma":"كَانَ","root":"كون","entryId":"l-4b2f9969a9af0d45"},{"key":"25:67:9","position":9,"arabic":"بَيْنَ","kind":"word","gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","lemma":"بَيْن","root":"بين","entryId":"l-32db43d0920d28f8"},{"key":"25:67:10","position":10,"arabic":"ذَٰلِكَ","kind":"word","gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","root":null,"entryId":"l-096a9ad382db7640"},{"key":"25:67:11","position":11,"arabic":"قَوَامًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"moderate","transliteration":"qawāman","lemma":"قَوَام","root":"قوم","entryId":null},{"key":"25:67:12","position":12,"arabic":"٦٧","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}],"translation":"And those who, when they spend, are neither extravagant nor niggardly, but hold a medium (way) between those (extremes).","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"targetKey":"25:67:3","targetGloss":"they spend","targetTransliteration":"anfaqū","sourceIds":["qul-56","qul-92","qul-71","qul-75","qul-76","qul-301"]}]}